cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "bio-claim-check: checking life-science agent claims against the abstracts they cite"
abstract: >-
  An open-source claim checker for life-science agents (pre-alpha, in development). It is designed to
  answer a research question from Europe PMC abstracts, check every claim against the paper it cites,
  and measure what the verifier catches with planted traps.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/squliyev/bio-claim-check"
keywords:
  - claim verification
  - life science
  - LLM evaluation
  - scientific spin
authors:
  - family-names: Guliyev
    given-names: Samir
version: 0.0.1
